      "value": "This would be great, especially if we can code custom animation parameters. This is my number one feature request right now.\n\nWhat is especially frustrating about this is that there is no indication in the SDK that you cannot do this. So unless you expreiment for hours trying to get it to work you might not realise it won't work.",
